# The proxy is a native Rust binary: it needs the workspace manifests and the
# crates, and nothing else. Without this, its context would carry the 70 MB
# Pyodide runtime, the example datasets and the SeisBench weights that only the
# web image reads — none of which it would ever COPY, all of which it would wait
# for. (BuildKit prefers a `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` over the root one.)
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!.cargo
!crates
**/.DS_Store
